            <trans-unit id="module.empty.message"><source>Once event records exist, they show up here.</source></trans-unit>

            <trans-unit id="module.noStorage.title"><source>No storage folder configured</source></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="module.noStorage.message"><source>Set a storage PID in the extension configuration (Admin Tools &gt; Extensions &gt; Rubin Events) to create new events straight from this module.</source></trans-unit>

