            <trans-unit id="module.branding.cta.text"><source>Something not working as it should, or a feature missing? Report it on GitHub and it gets looked at.</source></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="module.branding.cta.button"><source>Report an issue</source></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="module.branding.copyright"><source>Rubin Events %s — © Pagea Development</source></trans-unit>

            <trans-unit id="module.missingStorage.title"><source>Storage folder does not exist</source></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="module.missingStorage.message"><source>The extension configuration points to page %s, which does not exist. Correct the storage PID under Admin Tools &gt; Extensions &gt; Rubin Events to create new events from here.</source></trans-unit>
